Package: TestCallr
Title: Sends Functions to Other R Processes with callr
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: "First Last <first.last@example.com> [aut, cre]"
Description: Functions that pass a function defined in the package to
    callr, which removes the source references of a function before it is
    sent to another R process.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.1.2)
Suggests: callr
